source: crates/explain/src/codes/tests.rs
expression: shown(code)
---
$ mix install ripgrep
error: `mix` needs systemd, and it isn't running

help: turn it on: add `[boot]` with `systemd=true` to `/etc/wsl.conf`, run `wsl.exe --shutdown` from Windows, then reopen the distro

$ mix explain systemd-not-ready
SYSTEMD_NOT_READY

This system does not run systemd as its init system.

`mix` runs the Nix daemon as a systemd service.

To fix it:
  - turn systemd on: on WSL, add `systemd=true` under `[boot]` in `/etc/wsl.conf` and restart the distro
  - run the command again
